# Manufacturing Engineering Manager
**Teledyne**
Miamisburg, OH, United States Full Time
Reference: Teledyne_REQ36936
**Be visionary**

...

We are presently seeking a **Manufacturing Engineering Manager** who will be responsible for leading a team of 11 (8 engineers and 3 technicians). This manager will lead the department to achieve greater efficiency and productivity to meet operational and financial goals, help develop, train and sustain a positive, high-energy workforce in a continuous improvement environment, and meet customer schedules, specifications and quality requirements.

...

* Bachelor of Science degree in Engineering preferred or similar experience (Manufacturing, Industrial, Mechanical or other engineering discipline (Master's degree preferred);
* A minimum of 2 years management experience;
* Must be able to work with other engineering groups to solve complex issues;
* Experience managing and mentoring engineers and technicians;

...

* Able to quickly gain the confidence and cooperation of others;
* At least 5 years experience in a manufacturing and/or regulatory environment;
* Proven ability to develop and implement strategic and tactical plans;
* Customer-focused manager with demonstrated ability to schedule, forecast and meet deadlines;
* Believer and driver of continuous improvement activities that will deploy Lean methodology and Six Sigma quality throughout the organization;

...

